            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Hi Andrew! Thank you so much for your review! We're so glad the home worked well for your family. It was a pleasure hosting you, and we’d love to welcome you back! -Nicole",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Family of 13 stayed. Everything in house is awesome. Elevator was clutch for my father who has limited mobility. Would definitely come back! Hosts were super responsive and helpful",
        "title": "Great for big group"
      },
      {
        "author": "Anuradha N.",
        "date": "2025-05-01T19:06:44Z",
        "id": "6813d4f707a6af00d5dfe4c6",
        "label": "Excellent",
