        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "May 5, 2025",
            "id": "ff138943-09a0-4156-a34a-0b5e4c303a1d",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Anuradha! Thank you for your review! We’re so glad you had a wonderful time. We'd love to host you again! -Nicole",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had a wonderful time. The house was spacious and the pool, hot tub and proximity to the beach was nice. Only opportunity is the construction across the way which wasn’t really a big deal but wish we knew about since it was louder when at the pool.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Girls Weekend",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Casey H.",
        "date": "2023-11-02T14:47:46Z",
        "id": "6543b693a59c314f93eebb58",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This house is awesome, exactly as described in the listing. We arrived to find the pool pre-heated and house clean. The property manager was fantastic in getting back to us on any questions we had about the house, pool, beach etc. We visited in October, so the beach we pretty much our own private beach. Overall a fantastic house for large groups. We would definitely stay their again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Perfect 40th Birthday Trip",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Debbie S.",
        "date": "2024-01-17T01:32:23Z",
        "id": "65a72e28d966fc577ab04d24",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Clean, well appointed home, beautiful beach. Spacious kitchen, dining area and family room. Great for large group. Loved having 2 dishwashers. Every bedroom with their own bathroom. Ideal for extended family stay to celebrate my Mom’s 80th!!\nNew home construction near by.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Fabulous",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Michele M.",
        "date": "2023-12-02T16:07:08Z",
        "id": "656b562cc6619c7fbba80450",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Beautiful Home. Plenty of room for 14. Property Manager was very helpful and responded to our calls promptly. Looking forward to house having direct access to the beach from home boardwalk (current construction in area delaying access).\nWould recommend performing preventive maintenance. We had to deal with alarms (garage, smoke alarms then pool) going off during the day and night due to dead backup batteries. Change HVAC air filters. The filters were badly clogged with dust. Replace worn bed coverings.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Destination Wedding",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
